{
  "id": "6a7c30748e271471b3ad3475",
  "title": "ブル型投信・ベア型投信",
  "created": 1786523766,
  "updated": 1786528023,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a7c30748e271471b3ad3475",
      "text": "ブル型投信・ベア型投信",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786523766,
      "updated": 1786523766
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c31c300000000005e45dd",
      "text": "前提：",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786524099,
      "updated": 1786525436
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c36fc00000000005e4600",
      "text": " [インデックス型投信]：特定の指数に合わせた価格になるように運用される[投資信託]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786525436,
      "updated": 1786525450
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c36f800000000005e45ff",
      "text": " [騰落率]：前日の価格と当日の価格の差分…の前日価格に対する割合",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786525433,
      "updated": 1786526485
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c375000000000005e4601",
      "text": " \t[$ r(x)=\\frac{f(x)-f(x-1)}{f(x-1)}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786525521,
      "updated": 1786525708
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c31ca00000000005e45de",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786524107,
      "updated": 1786524107
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c307600000000005e45cc",
      "text": "[ブル型投信]：[騰落率]に（1より大きい）[レバレッジ倍率]がかけられている[投資信託]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786523766,
      "updated": 1786526182
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c345700000000005e45f2",
      "text": "\t[$ \\lbrack前日の基準価格\\rbrack\\times(1+\\lbrack基準指数の前日比騰落率\\rbrack\\times\\lbrackレバレッジ倍率)\\rbrack]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786524760,
      "updated": 1786525025
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c34e400000000005e45f4",
      "text": "\t同じことだが：",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786524901,
      "updated": 1786525075
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c359200000000005e45f5",
      "text": "\t\t[$ {\\rm bull}(x)={\\rm bull}(x-1)\\times\\left\\lbrace1+\\left(\\frac{{\\rm index}(x)-{\\rm index}(x-1)}{{\\rm index}(x-1)}\\right)\\times\\alpha_{>1}\\right\\rbrace]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786525075,
      "updated": 1786526529
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c360900000000005e45f7",
      "text": "\t[騰落率]は以下のようになる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786525193,
      "updated": 1786526461
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c3a3100000000005e4603",
      "text": "\t\t[$ \\frac{{\\rm bull}(x)-{\\rm bull}(x-1)}{{\\rm bull}(x-1)}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786526258,
      "updated": 1786526437
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c3ae400000000005e4606",
      "text": "\t\t\t[$ =\\frac{{\\rm bull}(x)}{{\\rm bull}(x-1)}-1]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786526437,
      "updated": 1786526437
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c3a7400000000005e4604",
      "text": "\t\t\t[$ =\\left\\lbrace1+\\left(\\frac{{\\rm index}(x)-{\\rm index}(x-1)}{{\\rm index}(x-1)}\\right)\\times\\alpha_{>1}\\right\\rbrace-1]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786526325,
      "updated": 1786526538
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c3aba00000000005e4605",
      "text": "\t\t\t[$ =\\left(\\frac{{\\rm index}(x)-{\\rm index}(x-1)}{{\\rm index}(x-1)}\\right)\\times\\alpha_{>1}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786526394,
      "updated": 1786526545
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c36ea00000000005e45fe",
      "text": "[ベア型投信]：[騰落率]に負の[レバレッジ倍率]がかけられている[投資信託]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786525418,
      "updated": 1786526394
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c307e00000000005e45ce",
      "text": "\t[$ \\lbrack前日の基準価格\\rbrack\\times(1+\\lbrack基準指数の前日比騰落率\\rbrack\\times\\lbrackレバレッジ倍率)\\rbrack]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786523774,
      "updated": 1786526560
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c3b5f00000000005e4608",
      "text": "\t同じことだが：",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786526560,
      "updated": 1786526560
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c3b5f00000000005e4609",
      "text": "\t\t[$ {\\rm bear}(x)={\\rm bear}(x-1)\\times\\left\\lbrace1+\\left(\\frac{{\\rm index}(x)-{\\rm index}(x-1)}{{\\rm index}(x-1)}\\right)\\times\\alpha_{<0}\\right\\rbrace]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786526560,
      "updated": 1786526682
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c3b5f00000000005e4607",
      "text": "\t[騰落率]は以下のようになる",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786526560,
      "updated": 1786526599
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c3b8700000000005e460a",
      "text": "\t\t[$ \\frac{{\\rm bear}(x)-{\\rm bear}(x-1)}{{\\rm bear}(x-1)}=\\left(\\frac{{\\rm index}(x)-{\\rm index}(x-1)}{{\\rm index}(x-1)}\\right)\\times\\alpha_{<0}]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786526599,
      "updated": 1786526693
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7c3b9b00000000005e460c",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1786526619,
      "updated": 1786526619
    },
